{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:2EB94A444839",
  "root": "u5",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 109,
      "text": "Some schools offer an option for students\u00a0to attend classes from home by way of online or video conferencing.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 110,
      "end": 240,
      "text": "Schools think that it is a benefit that help\u00a0students who don't want to go school or if they have\u00a0diseases, they can't go schools.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "reported",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 241,
      "end": 301,
      "text": "Taking classes in home or schools have some\u00a0similar benefits",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 302,
      "end": 327,
      "text": "but not overall benefits.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 329,
      "end": 510,
      "text": "Although, I think taking classes from home have benefits and not\u00a0because some students have health problems and\u00a0it is not a benefit because students can't learn good like in school.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 512,
      "end": 563,
      "text": "At first, taking classes from home can be a benefit",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 564,
      "end": 677,
      "text": "because it\u00a0helps students who have health problems like students that have problems to walk or different disease.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 678,
      "end": 750,
      "text": "Also, for students that their parents don't let them to go for problems.",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 751,
      "end": 820,
      "text": "For example, if students who have arthritis, they can't go to schools",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 821,
      "end": 845,
      "text": "because they\u00a0can't walk.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 846,
      "end": 873,
      "text": "It would be better for they",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 874,
      "end": 958,
      "text": "because taking\u00a0classes by online or they can make a video conferencing with a tutor.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 959,
      "end": 1052,
      "text": "They can learn about all classes they want to know and it would be a benefit for their future",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 1053,
      "end": 1112,
      "text": "because they\u00a0will get a diploma that will be help for them.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 1113,
      "end": 1213,
      "text": "Also, it can be a benefit for students that had problems in schools like fight with others students.",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 1214,
      "end": 1288,
      "text": "Those students can take classes in home with help of someone or by online.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1289,
      "end": 1355,
      "text": "In this way, they can get help and learn things without go school.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 1357,
      "end": 1436,
      "text": "Moreover, I think it is not a benefit for students who don't want to go schools",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1437,
      "end": 1514,
      "text": "because if they don't like the schools, they will be doing whatever they want",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 1515,
      "end": 1573,
      "text": "because there won't be a teacher who tell them what to do;",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 1574,
      "end": 1599,
      "text": "and they can't learn good",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u24",
      "start": 1600,
      "end": 1652,
      "text": "because there are no one who explain them the class.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 1653,
      "end": 1733,
      "text": "There are many students who don't speak English and they don't want to go school",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 1734,
      "end": 1757,
      "text": "but they want to learn.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u27",
      "start": 1758,
      "end": 1800,
      "text": "For example, I can't speak English so good",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u28",
      "start": 1801,
      "end": 1836,
      "text": "because I am not a native American,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u29",
      "start": 1837,
      "end": 1946,
      "text": "so if I don't want to go school and want to learn the language, taking classes from home would be hard for me",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u30",
      "start": 1947,
      "end": 1995,
      "text": "because in home I will learn slower than schools",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u31",
      "start": 1996,
      "end": 2088,
      "text": "because in schools are many people speaking English and in home I just hear one time at day.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u32",
      "start": 2089,
      "end": 2137,
      "text": "It better\u00a0if I hear English the most of the time",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u33",
      "start": 2138,
      "end": 2165,
      "text": "because I can learn so fast",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u34",
      "start": 2166,
      "end": 2205,
      "text": "because I will make friends to help me.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u35",
      "start": 2206,
      "end": 2257,
      "text": "For me, taking class in schools is better than home",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u36",
      "start": 2258,
      "end": 2323,
      "text": "because now I go to school and it is hard even if I go to school.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u37",
      "start": 2324,
      "end": 2385,
      "text": "I am improving the language with help of teacher and friends.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u38",
      "start": 2387,
      "end": 2462,
      "text": "In conclusion, taking classes from home is not a hundred percent a benefit.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u39",
      "start": 2463,
      "end": 2508,
      "text": "It just have some benefits for some students.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u40",
      "start": 2509,
      "end": 2559,
      "text": "For some students taking classes from home is hard",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u41",
      "start": 2560,
      "end": 2594,
      "text": "because they don't learn too much.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u42",
      "start": 2595,
      "end": 2665,
      "text": "Overall, if I\u00a0take classes in home or school, it is something relevant",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u43",
      "start": 2666,
      "end": 2735,
      "text": "because even if I am in one or anther place, I am learning something.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u44",
      "start": 2736,
      "end": 2769,
      "text": "It is not a thing of other world.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u45",
      "start": 2770,
      "end": 2848,
      "text": "It is just for students that have the purpose to learn and be someone in life.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u46",
      "start": 2849,
      "end": 2901,
      "text": "Going to school help me to improve my life each day.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u47",
      "start": 2902,
      "end": 2970,
      "text": "Each day, I can learn something new and now my language is improving",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u48",
      "start": 2971,
      "end": 3040,
      "text": "because I have people who want to teach me and I am a stronger person",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u49",
      "start": 3041,
      "end": 3074,
      "text": "because no one can laughing of me",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u50",
      "start": 3075,
      "end": 3097,
      "text": "because I am learning.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
